# Compact 152x72 Kessler surface compound. The larger atlas reservation remains untouched so
# future event staging, patrols, and the proving-ground fight have protected exterior space.
size 152 72
surface 54
entrance 61 42 3 10

# Clear only occupied architectural volumes. Natural terrain remains outside the compound and
# CorporateTerrainIntegration keys the foundation directly into the Wastes surface.
clear 2 9 24 47
clear 24 29 14 27
clear 36 0 80 56
clear 114 29 14 27
clear 126 9 24 47

# Connected perimeter wall. Each checkpoint is a two-stage guard tower with an elevated watchpod,
# a lower inspection room, an open ground passage, and an inward patrol walk.
frame KesslerBlock 4 30 20 25 2
wall KesslerBulkheadWall 6 32 16 21
wall KesslerWindowWall 8 34 12 6
platform KesslerPlatform 6 40 7
platform KesslerPlatform 15 40 7
fill KesslerTrim 2 27 24 3
frame KesslerBlock 8 18 12 12 2
wall KesslerWindowWall 10 20 8 8
fill KesslerTrim 6 15 16 3
fill KesslerBeam 12 9 4 6
erase 21 44 3 8
object KesslerLight 13 21 1 1
object KesslerLight 9 35 1 1
object KesslerLight 19 46 1 1

