# Roof-shoulder standards identify the Campus beyond the perimeter without stretching the command
# crown. Their cloth remains open-air and their poles anchor to compact reinforced plinths.
fill KesslerTrim 40 13 8 4
fill KesslerTrim 104 13 8 4
object KesslerWarBanner 42 9 4 4
object KesslerWarBanner 106 9 4 4

# Public frontage. The west opening and quartermaster booth are reachable on day one; the separate
# internal bulkhead named by `entrance` remains sealed until Kessler completes its arrival test.
erase 38 43 3 9
fill KesslerGlass 61 42 3 10
